MySQLi: access to MySQL and MariaDB servers, through mysqlnd. With
php56-mysqlnd; php56-mysqli-openssl is the same for
php56-mysqlnd-openssl.

The module mysqli of PHP 5.6 for php56 of azsupport/ports,
which installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20131226/mysqli.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php56/conf.d,
its headers in include/php56/php/ext/mysqli.
